0dfc8328de38bc34bff2f32a1122b2654cdb2b48261b8fc6398f01f6519203ff1ba3bd75f7a8bab3678d7cf8a5922dc3720d663eaaa0bcad037aa4948f67a35b  0001-tests-Open-and-release-services-by-UID.patch
"
